    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="42.6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 42.6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Æfter þære ilcan wisan mon mot feohtan mid his geborene mæge, gif hine mon on woh onfeohteð, buton wið his hlaforde: þæt we ne liefeð.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In the same manner a man may fight at the side of his born kin, if they are attacked wrongfully, except against his lord: that we do not allow.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">In the same way a man may fight on behalf of one who is related to him by blood, if he is attacked unjustly, except it be against his lord. This we do not permit.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Æfter ðære ilcan wisan mon mot feohtan mid his geborenum mæge, gif him mon on wóh onfeohteð, buton wið his hlaforde: ðæt we ne lyfað.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
